WEBVTT

00:00:00.492 --> 00:00:01.084
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.098 --> 00:00:05.941
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> My mum took this photo when we <b>were</b> travelling in Malaysia.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:08.579
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.695 --> 00:00:12.191
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> We met our new neighbours yesterday –

00:00:12.366 --> 00:00:13.894
they <b>weren’t</b> very friendly.

00:00:16.328 --> 00:00:16.968
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:20.507
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What <b>were</b> you doing when I phoned you?

00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:23.184
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:26.314
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> <b>Was</b> Lucas at home last night?

00:00:27.124 --> 00:00:28.706
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> No, he <b>wasn’t</b>.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:31.606
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.819 --> 00:00:34.548
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> It <b>was</b> a great party.

00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:36.486
<v><b>Speaker B:</b></v> <b>Was</b> it at Kim’s house?

00:00:36.656 --> 00:00:38.031
<v><b>Speaker A:</b></v> Yes, it <b>was</b>.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.052
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.709
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> There <b>were</b> lots of people at the supermarket.